    "body": "Sub-issues for reading 1 (one for each kind that shows the Boundary group but not \"Do not touch\"). Each has `Refs #2055` and `Refs #3335`:\n\n- #3343 Face (`effort:high`)\n- #3344 Contour (`effort:high`)\n- #3345 2D Pocket (`effort:high`)\n- #3346 Adaptive2D (`effort:high`)\n- #3347 Finish3D (`effort:max`: a 3D surface generator)\n- #3348 Trace (`effort:high`)\n- #3349 Engrave (`effort:high`)\n\nThe kinds without a Boundary group (Drill, Slot, Probe and the other kinds) get no sub-issue. Their Boundary settings do not apply.\n",
